{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27287","headline":"望禁苑祥光 · 蒋防","name":"望禁苑祥光","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉瑞生天色，葱茏几效祥。\n树摇三殿侧，日映九城傍。\n仙雾今同色，卿云未可章。\n拱汾疑鼎气，临渭比荧光。\n岂并春风旧，俄同圣寿长。\n微臣时一望，短羽欲翺翔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27287.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27287","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}